<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Teatru El Llar · 25 Años Contigu! — Gala de Cumpleañu · Programa interactivo</title>
<meta name="description" content="Programa interactivo de les Gala de Cumpleañu del Teatru El Llar (Corvera de Asturias), 25 años contigu: sábadu 26 y domingu 27 de setiembre de 2026. Filtra por gala y tipu d'actuación, busca artistes, consulta la cuenta atrás y exporta'l programa a PDF.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#241b3a">
<meta name="author" content="Teatru El Llar — Ayuntamiento de Corvera de Asturias">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<link rel="canonical" href="./">
<link rel="manifest" href="manifest.webmanifest">
<link rel="icon" href="img/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="img/icon-192.png">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:locale" content="es_ES">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Teatru El Llar · 25 Años Contigu!">
<meta property="og:title" content="Teatru El Llar · 25 Años Contigu! — Gala de Cumpleañu 2026">
<meta property="og:description" content="Programa interactivo de les Gala de Cumpleañu: sábadu 26 y domingu 27 de setiembre de 2026, 19h. Filtros por gala y tipu d'actuación, búsqueda y exportación a PDF.">
<meta property="og:image" content="img/gala_sabado_26.jpg">
<meta property="og:url" content="./">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Teatru El Llar · 25 Años Contigu! — Gala de Cumpleañu 2026">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="Programa interactivo de les Gala de Cumpleañu: 26 y 27 de setiembre de 2026, 19h.">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="img/gala_sabado_26.jpg">
<style>
  :root{
    --cream:#f7efdd;
    --paper:#fffdf6;
    --ink:#2a2118;
    --ink-soft:#5c5044;
    --green:#2e7d3a;
    --green-dark:#1f5a29;
    --purple:#5b2a86;
    --purple-dark:#3f1d5e;
    --red:#c62828;
    --gold:#e6b325;
    --pink:#d81b60;
    --night:#241b3a;
    --shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(42,33,24,.14);
    --radius:16px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    font-family:"Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,"Trebuchet MS",sans-serif;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--cream);
    min-height:100vh;
    line-height:1.45;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(rgba(230,179,37,.18) 1.5px, transparent 1.6px),
      radial-gradient(rgba(91,42,134,.10) 1.2px, transparent 1.3px);
    background-size: 56px 56px, 38px 38px;
    background-position: 0 0, 19px 27px;
  }
  button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;color:inherit}
  input,select{font:inherit;color:inherit}
  .hidden{display:none !important}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
    color:#fff;
    text-align:center;
    padding:34px 18px 26px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 12% 20%, rgba(230,179,37,.25), transparent 32%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 15%, rgba(216,27,96,.28), transparent 34%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 90%, rgba(46,125,58,.35), transparent 40%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, #31234f 0%, var(--night) 45%, #14202e 100%);
    border-bottom:6px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"★ · ★ · ★ · ★ · ★ · ★ · ★ · ★ · ★ · ★ · ★ · ★";
    position:absolute;inset:8px 0 auto 0;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);letter-spacing:6px;font-size:12px;
  }
  .hero-kicker{
    display:inline-block;
    background:var(--gold);color:#3a2c05;
    font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:.72rem;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:12px;
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
    font-size:clamp(2.1rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    line-height:1.02;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    text-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  .hero h1 .llar{color:#8ee06b}
  .hero-25{
    margin-top:8px;
    font-family:Georgia,serif;
    font-size:clamp(1.2rem, 3.5vw, 1.9rem);
    color:var(--gold);
    text-shadow:0 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  .hero-25 .num{
    display:inline-block;
    background:var(--red);
    padding:2px 14px;border-radius:12px;
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3);
    transform:rotate(-2deg);
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top:14px;font-size:1.02rem;color:#f3e9c8;max-width:720px;margin-inline:auto;
  }
  .hero-stats{
    margin-top:18px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;
  }
  .stat{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28);
    backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
    padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;
  }
  .stat b{color:var(--gold)}

  /* ---------- CUENTA ATRÁS ---------- */
  .countdown{margin-top:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .cd-label{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#f3e9c8;font-size:.98rem}
  .cd-boxes{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
  .cd-box{
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.38);
    border:2px solid var(--gold);border-radius:14px;
    min-width:76px;padding:8px 12px 6px;
    box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  }
  .cd-box b{
    display:block;font-size:1.75rem;color:#fff;line-height:1;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  }
  .cd-box span{font-size:.66rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold)}
  .cd-live{
    background:var(--red);color:#fff;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:999px;
    font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.06em;box-shadow:0 4px 0 #8e1c1c;
    animation:blink 1.1s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes blink{50%{opacity:.62}}
  .cd-mini{
    color:#fff;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:999px;
    padding:8px 14px;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem;
    font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .cd-mini b{color:var(--gold)}
  .cd-mini.live{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);animation:blink 1.1s infinite}

  /* ---------- TABS ---------- */
  .tabs{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;
    display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;
    padding:12px 12px;
    background:rgba(36,27,58,.95);
    border-bottom:3px solid var(--gold);
  }
  .tab-btn{
    color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-weight:800;
    border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);letter-spacing:.02em;
    transition:.18s;
  }
  .tab-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .tab-btn.active{background:var(--gold);color:#3a2c05;border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.3)}

  main{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 60px}

  /* ---------- TOOLBAR ---------- */
  .toolbar{
    background:var(--paper);
    border:2px solid #e4d6b4;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    padding:16px;
    display:grid;gap:14px;
  }
  .toolbar-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center}
  .search-wrap{position:relative;flex:1 1 260px}
  .search-wrap .ico{position:absolute;left:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:1rem;opacity:.7}
  #q{
    width:100%;padding:11px 40px 11px 38px;border-radius:12px;
    border:2px solid #d9c9a3;background:#fff;font-size:1rem;
  }
  #q:focus{outline:3px solid rgba(91,42,134,.25);border-color:var(--purple)}
  .q-clear{
    position:absolute;right:8px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);
    width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:#eee2c6;font-weight:900;color:#6b5b3d;
  }
  .q-clear:hover{background:var(--red);color:#fff}
  .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-width:180px;flex:0 1 auto}
  .field label{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .field select{
    padding:10px 34px 10px 12px;border-radius:12px;border:2px solid #d9c9a3;background:#fff;
    appearance:none;
    background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='14' height='14' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%235b2a86' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round'><path d='M6 9l6 6 6-6'/></svg>");
    background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:right 12px center;
    font-weight:600;
  }
  .field select:focus{outline:3px solid rgba(91,42,134,.25);border-color:var(--purple)}
  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center}
  .chips .lbl{font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-right:2px}
  .chip{
    border:2px solid #d9c9a3;background:#fff;border-radius:999px;
    padding:7px 14px;font-weight:800;font-size:.85rem;transition:.15s;
  }
  .chip:hover{border-color:var(--purple);transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .chip.active{background:var(--purple);border-color:var(--purple);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 0 rgba(63,29,94,.4)}
  .chip.fav.active{background:var(--pink);border-color:var(--pink);box-shadow:0 3px 0 rgba(216,27,96,.35)}
  .btn{
    border-radius:12px;padding:10px 16px;font-weight:800;transition:.15s;
    border:2px solid transparent;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .btn-outline{border-color:#d9c9a3;background:#fff}
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--purple);color:var(--purple)}
  .btn-green{background:var(--green);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 0 var(--green-dark)}
  .btn-green:active{transform:translateY(2px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--green-dark)}
  .btn-red{background:var(--red);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 0 #8e1c1c}
  .btn-red:active{transform:translateY(2px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 #8e1c1c}
  .btn-purple{background:var(--purple);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 0 var(--purple-dark)}
  .btn-purple:active{transform:translateY(2px);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--purple-dark)}
  .view-toggle{display:flex;border:2px solid #d9c9a3;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}
  .view-toggle .chip{border:none;border-radius:0;box-shadow:none}
  .view-toggle .chip.active{background:var(--green);color:#fff}
  .spacer{flex:1}

  .count-bar{
    margin:16px 2px 12px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 18px;align-items:baseline;
    font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .count-bar b{color:var(--ink);font-size:1.05rem}

  /* ---------- CARDS ---------- */
  .grid{
    display:grid;gap:16px;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(270px,1fr));
  }
  .card{
    background:var(--paper);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    border:2px solid #e4d6b4;
    border-top:7px solid var(--tipo, var(--purple));
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    padding:14px 15px 12px;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:.18s;
    position:relative;
  }
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 30px rgba(42,33,24,.2);border-color:var(--tipo, var(--purple))}
  .card-badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;min-height:26px}
  .badge{
    font-size:.7rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.03em;
    padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .badge.sab{background:var(--red)}
  .badge.dom{background:var(--purple)}
  .badge.both{background:var(--green)}
  .badge.excl{background:var(--gold);color:#3a2c05}
  .card h3{
    font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.18rem;line-height:1.15;text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .card .papel{font-style:italic;color:var(--purple);font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem}
  .card .desc{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--ink-soft);flex:1}
  .card-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:4px}
  .tag{
    font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;
    background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--tipo, var(--purple)) 14%, #fff);
    color:var(--tipo, var(--purple));
    border:1.5px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--tipo, var(--purple)) 45%, #fff);
    padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;
  }
  .card-actions{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:6px}
  .icon-btn{
    width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #d9c9a3;background:#fff;
    font-size:1rem;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:.15s;
  }
  .icon-btn:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}
  .icon-btn.on{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 2px 0 #b08a12}
  .btn-mini{
    border:2px solid var(--purple);color:var(--purple);border-radius:999px;
    padding:6px 12px;font-weight:800;font-size:.78rem;
  }
  .btn-mini:hover{background:var(--purple);color:#fff}

  /* ---------- CARTELERA ---------- */
  .cartelera{display:grid;gap:18px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr))}
  .day-col{
    background:var(--paper);border:2px solid #e4d6b4;border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;
  }
  .day-head{padding:14px 16px;color:#fff}
  .day-col.sab .day-head{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--red),#8e1c1c)}
  .day-col.dom .day-head{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--purple),var(--purple-dark))}
  .day-head h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.2rem;text-transform:uppercase}
  .day-head .meta{font-size:.82rem;opacity:.92;margin-top:2px}
  .day-head .pres{font-size:.8rem;margin-top:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:10px}
  .day-list{list-style:none;padding:10px 12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
  .day-list li{
    display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;
    padding:9px 10px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #eee2c6;
    cursor:pointer;transition:.15s;
  }
  .day-list li:hover{border-color:var(--purple);transform:translateX(3px)}
  .order{
    flex:0 0 34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;
    font-weight:900;color:#fff;font-size:.85rem;background:var(--tipo, var(--purple));
  }
  .order.star{background:var(--gold);color:#3a2c05}
  .day-list .nm{font-weight:800;font-size:.92rem;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.15}
  .day-list .pp{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .day-empty{padding:18px;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center;font-style:italic}

  /* ---------- EMPTY ---------- */
  .empty{
    text-align:center;padding:44px 18px;background:var(--paper);
    border:2px dashed #d9c9a3;border-radius:var(--radius);
  }
  .empty .big{font-size:2.6rem}
  .empty h3{font-family:Georgia,serif;margin:8px 0 6px}
  .empty p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:14px}

  /* ---------- CARTELES TAB ---------- */
  .poster-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px}
  .posters{display:grid;gap:22px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr))}
  figure.poster{
    background:var(--paper);padding:14px;border-radius:var(--radius);
    border:2px solid #e4d6b4;box-shadow:var(--shadow);margin:0;
  }
  figure.poster img{
    width:100%;border-radius:10px;display:block;cursor:zoom-in;
    border:1px solid #e4d6b4;
  }
  figure.poster figcaption{
    text-align:center;font-weight:800;margin-top:10px;font-family:Georgia,serif;
  }
  figure.poster figcaption small{display:block;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:inherit}
  .poster-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:6px}
  .poster-tag.sab{background:var(--red)}
  .poster-tag.dom{background:var(--purple)}

  /* ---------- INFO TAB ---------- */
  .info-grid{display:grid;gap:18px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr))}
  .info-card{
    background:var(--paper);border:2px solid #e4d6b4;border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:20px;
  }
  .info-card h3{
    font-family:Georgia,serif;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  }
  .info-card p, .info-card li{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .info-card ul{margin:8px 0 0 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
  .info-card .hl{color:var(--ink);font-weight:800}
  .ticket{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff8e2,#ffe9a8);
    border:2px dashed var(--gold);
  }
  .info-slogans{
    margin-top:18px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;
  }
  .slogan{
    background:var(--night);color:var(--gold);border-radius:999px;
    padding:9px 18px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;
  }
  .place{margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .logo-cvn{
    background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--red);color:var(--red);
    font-weight:900;text-align:center;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;line-height:1.1;
    font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.04em;
  }
  .logo-cvn .ayto{color:#333;font-size:.62rem;display:block;border-bottom:1px solid var(--red);padding-bottom:3px;margin-bottom:3px}

  /* ---------- MODAL ---------- */
  .overlay{
    position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,14,32,.65);z-index:100;
    display:grid;place-items:center;padding:18px;
  }
  .modal{
    background:var(--paper);border-radius:20px;border:3px solid var(--gold);
    max-width:640px;width:100%;max-height:88vh;overflow:auto;
    padding:26px 24px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);position:relative;
  }
  .modal .close{
    position:absolute;top:12px;right:12px;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:1.05rem;
    box-shadow:0 3px 0 #8e1c1c;
  }
  .modal h2{font-family:Georgia,serif;text-transform:uppercase;padding-right:44px;line-height:1.1}
  .modal .papel{color:var(--purple);font-weight:700;font-style:italic;margin-top:4px}
  .modal .modal-badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:12px 0}
  .modal .desc{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:14px}
  .modal h4{
    text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin:16px 0 8px;border-bottom:2px solid #e4d6b4;padding-bottom:4px;
  }
  .act-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
  .act-list li{
    display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #eee2c6;
    border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;
  }
  .modal-foot{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .modal img.lightbox-img{width:100%;border-radius:12px;display:block}

  footer{
    text-align:center;padding:26px 14px 34px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.85rem;
    border-top:3px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(255,253,246,.8);
  }
  footer b{color:var(--purple)}

  @media (max-width:640px){
    .field{min-width:100%}
    .toolbar-row{align-items:stretch}
  }
  @media print{
    .tabs,.toolbar,.card-actions,.poster-controls,footer .btn,.countdown{display:none !important}
    .tab-panel{display:block !important}
    body{background:#fff}
    .card,.day-col{break-inside:avoid}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-kicker">Gala de Cumpleañu · Corvera de Asturias</div>
  <h1>Teatru <span class="llar">El Llar</span><br>25 Años Contigu!</h1>
  <div class="hero-25"><span class="num">25</span> años contigu!</div>
  <p class="hero-sub">Programa interactivo de las dos galas de cumpleañu: sábadu 26 y domingu 27 de setiembre de 2026, les dos a les 19h. Filtra, busca y descubre quién actúa. <i>¡Que viva el teatru!</i></p>
  <div class="hero-stats" id="hero-stats"></div>
  <div class="countdown" id="countdown" aria-live="polite"></div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs" role="tablist">
  <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="programa" role="tab">🎭 Programa</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="carteles" role="tab">🖼️ Carteles</button>
  <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="info" role="tab">🎟️ Entradas ya info</button>
  <span class="cd-mini" id="cd-mini">⏳ …</span>
</nav>

<main>
